## 20. Display State Logic

```ts
type DisplayMode =
  | 'main'
  | 'adzan'
  | 'iqamah'
  | 'syuruq'
  | 'friday_khutbah'
  | 'media_fullscreen';
```

Prioritas state:

```ts
if (isPrayerTimeNow) {
  mode = 'adzan';
} else if (isIqamahCountdownActive) {
  mode = 'iqamah';
} else if (isSyuruqReminderActive) {
  mode = 'syuruq';
} else if (isFridayKhutbahMode) {
  mode = 'friday_khutbah';
} else {
  mode = 'main';
}
```

