### Teknis
- [ ] Database migration tersedia.
- [ ] Seeder default tersedia.
- [ ] Upload storage public berjalan.
- [ ] Endpoint `/display/state` berjalan.
- [ ] UI berbahasa Indonesia.
- [ ] Timezone Asia/Jakarta.
- [ ] Build production berhasil.
- [ ] Nginx production siap.

